@startuml actor-state-machine
title Actor 状态机（ateapipb.Actor.Status）
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> SUSPENDED : "CreateActor\n(初始即 SUSPENDED，\n携带 Golden/Tag 快照引用)"

SUSPENDED --> RESUMING : "ResumeActor\n(网关请求触发或显式调用)"
RESUMING --> RUNNING : "atelet Restore 完成\n(worker IP 生效)"
RUNNING --> SUSPENDING : SuspendActor
SUSPENDING --> SUSPENDED : "checkpoint 上传完成\n快照入库，worker 释放"

RUNNING --> PAUSING : PauseActor
PAUSING --> PAUSED : "本地 checkpoint 完成\n(LocalSnapshotInfo 记录节点)"
PAUSED --> RESUMING : "ResumeActor\n(Scheduler 钉回快照所在节点)"

RESUMING --> CRASHED : "worker Pod 消失 /\nrestore 失败 / 前提校验失败"
RUNNING --> CRASHED : "worker Pod 被删\n(Syncer 检测)"
SUSPENDING --> CRASHED : "checkpoint 期间\nworker Pod 消失"
PAUSING --> CRASHED : "Finalize 时缺失\nworker NodeName"

CRASHED --> DELETING : DeleteActor
SUSPENDED --> DELETING : DeleteActor
DELETING --> [*] : "记录删除\n(快照 GC 尚未实现)"

note right of CRASHED
  CRASHED 为人工介入态：
  无自动恢复，需显式 DeleteActor；
  失败语义 = 前向恢复 + 客户端重试，
  没有补偿事务
end note
@enduml
